<title>USA: SABRE overallotment option exercised.</title>
<headline>SABRE overallotment option exercised.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>SABRE Group Holdings Inc said on Friday that underwriters of its overallotment option have exercised an option to buy an aditional 3.03 million shares.</p>
<p>SABRE shares gained 4-5/8 in its first day of trading to close at 31-5/8 on 9.9 million shares of volume. The company held  offering of 20.2 million shares.</p>
<p>SABRE is the travel reservation unit of AMR Corp.</p>
<p>Goldman Sachs was lead underwriter of the offering.</p>
